---
const title = 'Página no encontrada';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>{title}</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="error-page">
			<p class="code">404</p>
			<h1>{title}</h1>
			<p>Lo sentimos, la página que buscas no existe o fue movida.</p>
			<a href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
	:global(body) {
		margin: 0;
		min-height: 100vh;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		background: #0f172a;
		color: #e2e8f0;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
	}
	.error-page { padding: 2rem; text-align: center; }
	.code { margin: 0; color: #38bdf8; font-size: 7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; }
	h1 { margin: 1rem 0 .75rem; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3rem); }
	.error-page p:not(.code) { color: #94a3b8; }
	a {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
		padding: .75rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: .5rem;
		background: #38bdf8;
		color: #082f49;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	a:hover { background: #7dd3fc; }
</style>
